---
import BaseLayout from "@/layouts/BaseLayout.astro";
---
<BaseLayout title="Evidence before volume." description="Accuracy, evidence quality, technical relevance, and information gain take priority over article count.">
  <section class="shell route">
    <header class="route-head">
      <div class="kicker">/ EDITORIAL POLICY</div>
      <h1>Evidence before volume.</h1>
    </header>
    <div style="max-width:var(--reading);font:1.18rem/1.65 var(--reader)">
      <p>Accuracy, evidence quality, technical relevance, and information gain take priority over article count.</p>
<p>Material claims should use primary evidence where available. Vendor claims remain vendor claims.
Independent evidence is distinguished from interested-party evidence. Sponsored material must be
clearly labeled and advertising does not purchase editorial conclusions.</p>
<p>No story moves from the private newsroom into this website without explicit human approval.</p>
<p>AI may assist with discovery, research organization, verification support, drafting, and editing. Human editorial accountability remains: AI assistance does not remove responsibility for accuracy, and is not permission to fabricate reporting, people, sources, quotations, tests, or results.</p>
<p>If money or consideration pays for placement, it must be labeled: ADVERTISEMENT, SPONSORED, PARTNER MESSAGE, or another unmistakable designation. Advertising cannot buy conclusions.</p>
    </div>
  </section>
</BaseLayout>
